{"3502860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Caller of the Crows", "steam_appid": 3502860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BURN. SURVIVE. CALL THE CROWS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the <strong>Caller of the Crows</strong>, and you've landed with a flame thrower in a cornfield  which is  guarded by something much worse than old farm props. <strong>Scarecrows. Real ones.</strong> They don’t just stand around. They watch. They chase. And they don’t stop. Claim the cornfield and let your crows enjoy the sweet corns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/880431234fd407c3bd229a29f64ce9eb.avif?t=1779557786\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌽 <strong>CLASSIC MODE </strong>– <i>The original nightmare</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and burn every scarecrow <strong>prop</strong> in the maze. But with each one you torch; the <strong>main scarecrow wakes up</strong> and starts hunting. Can you finish the job before it finds you?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/3a2e9a30b7781d7e04cf6390bd1353f2.poster.avif?t=1779557786\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/3a2e9a30b7781d7e04cf6390bd1353f2.webm?t=1779557786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👁️ <strong>ECHO MODE </strong>– <i>They’re invisible. But not silent.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scarecrow can’t be seen in this mode. Instead, you have your trusty friend a crow who <strong>cries lower when it’s nearby</strong>. You need to burn all the props… without getting caught. Easy, right?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>FIGHTBACK MODE </strong>– <i>You’re not helpless this time</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue your crows and they’ll help by <strong>stunning the scarecrow</strong> with a deafening cry. When it's stunned, attack fast or pay the price when it recovers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/c140a740c9b956c3525b17435a7b1d0a.poster.avif?t=1779557786\" width=616 height=175 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/c140a740c9b956c3525b17435a7b1d0a.webm?t=1779557786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ <strong>CUSTOME MODE </strong>– <i>Your rules, your nightmare</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your own level. Choose what you face, how often, and how hard. Whether you want a casual run or pure hell, it’s up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>EVERYTHING BURNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corn, props, scarecrows, almost everything can catch fire. But be careful. The more you burn, the more they come. <strong>Fire keeps you alive</strong>, but it also <strong>brings them closer</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌽<strong> NEW MAZE EVERY TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is different. The mazes change. The threats shift. Some nights you’ll feel lucky. Others, you’ll barely make it out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐦‍⬛ <strong>CROWS ARE WAITING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your crows are scared. But if you can clear the fields, they’ll come. Every scarecrow you burn is a step closer to freedom for them, and maybe for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-- <strong>CAN YOU BURN YOUR WAY OUT? --</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fields call for fire. The crows' hunger. And the scarecrows… <strong>they are waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>--&gt;  CALLER OF THE CROWS  &lt;--</strong></u></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BURN. SURVIVE. CALL THE CROWS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the <strong>Caller of the Crows</strong>, and you've landed with a flame thrower in a cornfield  which is  guarded by something much worse than old farm props. <strong>Scarecrows. Real ones.</strong> They don’t just stand around. They watch. They chase. And they don’t stop. Claim the cornfield and let your crows enjoy the sweet corns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/880431234fd407c3bd229a29f64ce9eb.avif?t=1779557786\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌽 <strong>CLASSIC MODE </strong>– <i>The original nightmare</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and burn every scarecrow <strong>prop</strong> in the maze. But with each one you torch; the <strong>main scarecrow wakes up</strong> and starts hunting. Can you finish the job before it finds you?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/3a2e9a30b7781d7e04cf6390bd1353f2.poster.avif?t=1779557786\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/3a2e9a30b7781d7e04cf6390bd1353f2.webm?t=1779557786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👁️ <strong>ECHO MODE </strong>– <i>They’re invisible. But not silent.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scarecrow can’t be seen in this mode. Instead, you have your trusty friend a crow who <strong>cries lower when it’s nearby</strong>. You need to burn all the props… without getting caught. Easy, right?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>FIGHTBACK MODE </strong>– <i>You’re not helpless this time</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue your crows and they’ll help by <strong>stunning the scarecrow</strong> with a deafening cry. When it's stunned, attack fast or pay the price when it recovers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/c140a740c9b956c3525b17435a7b1d0a.poster.avif?t=1779557786\" width=616 height=175 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/c140a740c9b956c3525b17435a7b1d0a.webm?t=1779557786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ <strong>CUSTOME MODE </strong>– <i>Your rules, your nightmare</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your own level. Choose what you face, how often, and how hard. Whether you want a casual run or pure hell, it’s up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>EVERYTHING BURNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corn, props, scarecrows, almost everything can catch fire. But be careful. The more you burn, the more they come. <strong>Fire keeps you alive</strong>, but it also <strong>brings them closer</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌽<strong> NEW MAZE EVERY TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is different. The mazes change. The threats shift. Some nights you’ll feel lucky. Others, you’ll barely make it out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐦‍⬛ <strong>CROWS ARE WAITING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your crows are scared. But if you can clear the fields, they’ll come. Every scarecrow you burn is a step closer to freedom for them, and maybe for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-- <strong>CAN YOU BURN YOUR WAY OUT? --</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fields call for fire. The crows' hunger. And the scarecrows… <strong>they are waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>--&gt;  CALLER OF THE CROWS  &lt;--</strong></u></h2>", "short_description": "A horror survival game where you roam cornfields with a flamethrower, burning scarecrows to claim the land for your crows. Set everything on fire, stay one step ahead, and clear the way so your crows can enjoy the sweet corn. The scarecrows: guardians of the field, won’t go down easy. 🔥", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/e30e04f931802c70ee82286e624fb5dfca2ed8df/header.jpg?t=1779557786", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/86aa1e73cdcd17cfe58aded15717b94ec9b20113/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779557786", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/86aa1e73cdcd17cfe58aded15717b94ec9b20113/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779557786", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8250U @ 1.60GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1560 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8250U @ 1.60GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 Ti<br></li><li><s